{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620330/extras/b5dfedc4d44cc2b2ab6f783567290464.avif?t=1572582623\" width=620 height=140 /></span><br><br><i>Scrapper</i> is a fast paced action packed, space-flight game with rogue-lite elements. Play as a plucky Scavenger flying through treacherous terrain searching for salvage; dodging asteroids, ice crystals and ruined space ships all the while avoiding latent traps that could spell your doom...<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620330/extras/4d8b88bd674791854ba6fa945302d4d2.avif?t=1572582623\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><br>Take your ship in any direction you please as you explore the games varied locations and manoeuvre around dangerous obstacles. The worlds and levels that are created in <i>Scrapper</i> uses a chunk-based procedural generation system, making each and every run unique and creates fast-paced semi-randomized events within the core gameplay itself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620330/extras/ee2bb279a25ed45af065894f77342675.avif?t=1572582623\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><br>Scrapper gameplay is focused on it\u2019s short, action packed rogue-lite experience. Over the course of gameplay the player will accrue experience and \u2018scrap\u2019 which they will use to further unlock ships, parts and levels.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620330/extras/e09582f2c8895f8663fb16c04d6750bb.avif?t=1572582623\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><br>Each stage has multiple missions to choose from, ranging from finding rare minerals to avoiding deadly traps or simply trying to make it out alive. Harder missions get you bigger rewards!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620330/extras/6cd48381205efe5b6410ebd99e850868.avif?t=1572582623\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><br>Use your hard earned scrap from completing missions and challenges to purchase new ships, wings, and thrusters. These parts change how your ship moves and looks, allowing you to prepare for the different missions and fly with your own style.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620330/extras/be1be24e294b074d376e4c0ac969848b.avif?t=1572582623\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><br>Players will get the chance to compete with their friends and others players around the world as they attempt to gain the highest scores and secure bragging rights as the best pilot in the galaxy!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c9cecaa779db912bd3f6bfcf5d639bbb400dd8e0.jpg","localized_name":"Successful Salvage","name":"Successful Salvage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/620330/c9cecaa779db912bd3f6bfcf5d639bbb400dd8e0.jpg"},{"icon":"c9cecaa779db912bd3f6bfcf5d639bbb400dd8e0.jpg","localized_name":"Super Salvage","name":"Super Salvage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/620330/c9cecaa779db912bd3f6bfcf5d639bbb400dd8e0.jpg"},{"icon":"c9cecaa779db912bd3f6bfcf5d639bbb400dd8e0.jpg","localized_name":"Big Earner","name":"Big Earner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/620330/c9cecaa779db912bd3f6bfcf5d639bbb400dd8e0.jpg"},{"icon":"c9cecaa779db912bd3f6bfcf5d639bbb400dd8e0.jpg","localized_name":"Rookie Scrapper","name":"Rookie Scrapper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/620330/c9cecaa779db912bd3f6bfcf5d639bbb400dd8e0.jpg"},{"icon":"c9cecaa779db912bd3f6bfcf5d639bbb400dd8e0.jpg","locali